            <ArticleTitle>Backache.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>290-301</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>If a poll were taken of the conditions the average doctor finds most difficult and depressing to treat, backache would undoubtedly be near the top of the list. Yet a clear understanding of the anatomy and mechanism of injury, a thorough examination, and a logical plan of management would help alleviate the patient's and doctor's symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
